                <pb facs="0342" n="250" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg250"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince, Haiti</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 163.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to state to the Department
                    that Mr. Jimenez took the oath of office in the presence of the members of the
                    Chambers on November 14, 1899, and assumed the duties of President of the
                    Republic of Santo Domingo.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. F. Powell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
